/surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Jelkmann</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Role of blood platelets in infection and inflammation</article-title><source>J Interferon Cytokine Res</source><year>2002</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>913</fpage><lpage>922</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12396713</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1089/10799900260286623</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cognasse</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Hamzeh</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Chavarin</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Acquart</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Genin</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Garraud</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Evidence of Toll-like receptor molecules on human platelets</article-title><source>Immunol Cell Biol</source><year>2005</year><volume>83</volume><fpage>196</fpage><lpage>198</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15748217</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1440-1711.2005.01314.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Elzey</surname><given-names>BD</given-names></name><name><surname>Tian</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Jensen</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Swanson</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Lees</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Lentz</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Stein</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Nieswandt</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Davidson</surname><given-n